    "preamble": "Joby Varghese vs State Of Kerala on 20 June, 2024 Author: P.Somarajan Bench: P.Somarajan Crl.Rev.Pet No.734/2021 1/1 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.Somarajan Thursday, the 20th day of June 2024 / 30th Jyaishta, 1946 Crl.M.A 1 Of 2021 In Crl.Rev.Pet No. 734 Of 2021 Cmp 4254/2016 In Cc 1028/2015 Of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court-I, Ettumanoor Petitioner/Revision Petitioners/Petitioners/Accused: 1. Joby Varghese, S/O Varghese, Puthenparambil House, Muttambalam, Kottayam. 2. Saju Jospeh, Sugar N Spice Bakery And Super Market, Viii/734, M.C.Road, Thavalakkuzhy Ettumannoor, Residing At Sky Line Hill View Apartment - Iib, Muttambalam P.O., Kanjikuzhy, Kottayam. 3.P.I.Prakash James, P.I Lawerence & Company, 3,465, A & B, Pwd Road, Nettoor, Maradu, Cochin. 4. P.I.Lawrence & Company, Pwd Road, Maradu, Cochin. 5. M.Arun Kumar (Nominee M/S.A.V.Thomas Company) 17/2, Palladam Road, Othakalmandapam, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. 6.A.V.Thomas & Company, W-21/674, Beach Road, Alappuzha. Respondents/Respondents/Respondents/Complainant: 1. State Of Kerala, Represented By The Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam - 682031. 2. Food Safety Officer, Ettumanoor Circle, Ettumanoor, Kottayam District - 686631 3. * Director, Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India, Fda Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi- 110002 (* Suo Moto Impleaded As Addl R3 As Per Order Dated 16/1/2024 In Crl R P 734/2021) Application praying that in the circumstances stated therein the High Court be pleased to stay all further proceedings in C.C.No.1028/2015 of the Judicial First Class Magistrate - I, Ettumanoor, pending disposal of the above revision.",
